# UI rules

- All visible product UI is Russian.
- Do not expose English enum names directly to users.
- Keep user-facing strings centralized in the i18n layer where practical.
- Optimize for very fast manual hand entry.
- Important actions must work by click/tap, not hover only.
- Invalid actions should be disabled or rejected with a concise Russian explanation.
- Recommendation panel must separate:
  - действие;
  - размер;
  - ключевые метрики;
  - почему;
  - предупреждения.
- Always make it visible which Villain range/profile is currently used.
- Avoid visual clutter; poker table is primary, recommendation is secondary but prominent.
- Do not add decorative UI that slows manual hand entry.
